{"meta":{"id":"literal","category":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination","title":"리터럴 타입 (Literal) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"\"up\" | \"down\" 처럼 허용할 값 자체를 지정, as const","tags":["typescript","f-literal"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">리터럴 타입 (Literal) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> &quot;up&quot; | &quot;down&quot; 처럼 허용할 값 자체를 지정, as const</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">리터럴 타입 — 값 지정</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">type Direction = &quot;up&quot; | &quot;down&quot; | &quot;left&quot; | &quot;right&quot;;\r\nlet move: Direction = &quot;up&quot;;\r\n// move = &quot;forward&quot;;   // 오류: 지정한 값만 허용\r\n\r\ntype Dice = 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6;\r\ntype Yes = true;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">유니온이 <strong>타입</strong>을 지정한다면, 리터럴은 <strong>허용할 값 자체</strong>를 지정한다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">as const</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const ROLES = [&quot;admin&quot;, &quot;user&quot;, &quot;guest&quot;] as const;\r\ntype Role = typeof ROLES[number];   // &quot;admin&quot; | &quot;user&quot; | &quot;guest&quot;\r\n\r\nconst config = { mode: &quot;dark&quot; } as const;\r\n// config.mode = &quot;light&quot;;           // 오류: readonly</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>as const</code> 는 값을 리터럴 타입 + readonly 로 고정한다. 배열에서 값 목록 타입을 뽑을 때 자주 쓴다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">let vs const 추론</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let a = &quot;up&quot;;     // string   (바뀔 수 있으니 넓게)\r\nconst b = &quot;up&quot;;   // &quot;up&quot;     (바뀌지 않으니 리터럴)</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination/literal","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"type-combination","title":"타입 조합 · 제한","path":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination"}],"hasImage":false}